{"1379120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MechNest", "steam_appid": 1379120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆◆What is MechNest?◆◆</h2><br>MechNest is my solo project and my first work.<br><br>It's a balanced combination of roguelike, shooting, hack and slash.<br><br>The meaning of the title is &quot;den of mecha&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/deabc7c331839a1ea5711ac5a44c0860.poster.avif?t=1713077723\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/deabc7c331839a1ea5711ac5a44c0860.webm?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/deabc7c331839a1ea5711ac5a44c0860.mp4?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆◆ Roguelike ◆◆</h2><br>Dungeons and enemy characters are randomly generated and upgrades cannot be carried over to the next playthrough. (PermaDeath)<br>Defeating a boss unlocks new skills and custom appearance elements.<br>There are no leveling or multiplayer elements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/da5fba89ae1b560c391e8a0c06b8a912.poster.avif?t=1713077723\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/da5fba89ae1b560c391e8a0c06b8a912.webm?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/da5fba89ae1b560c391e8a0c06b8a912.mp4?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆◆ Shooting ◆◆</h2><br>MechNest's main shooting is designed without lock-on or homing elements.<br>It prioritizes shooting than action.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/a460f336f96a14dbfd941b8d65c3ff76.poster.avif?t=1713077723\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/a460f336f96a14dbfd941b8d65c3ff76.webm?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/a460f336f96a14dbfd941b8d65c3ff76.mp4?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆◆ Hack and Slash ◆◆</h2><br>Outside of the high difficulty dungeons, the game is designed to be more exhilarating than tense.<br>HP and shields heal automatically, so be bold enough to wipe out a bunch of enemies.<br>The core of the game is to fight the enemies that appear one after another.<br>There are no story elements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/ad433dafae3e03695fa4079b10a2eaff.poster.avif?t=1713077723\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/ad433dafae3e03695fa4079b10a2eaff.webm?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/ad433dafae3e03695fa4079b10a2eaff.mp4?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆◆Thank you for your support.◆◆</h2><br>MechNest is run by just two people, one developer and one promotional staff.<br><br>If you find it a bit of fun, please support us by sharing and reviewing it!<br><br>Recommended Twitter hashtags #MechNest<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/5984394295056364ab2a6a553c33c16c.poster.avif?t=1713077723\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/5984394295056364ab2a6a553c33c16c.webm?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/5984394295056364ab2a6a553c33c16c.mp4?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆◆What is MechNest?◆◆</h2><br>MechNest is my solo project and my first work.<br><br>It's a balanced combination of roguelike, shooting, hack and slash.<br><br>The meaning of the title is &quot;den of mecha&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/deabc7c331839a1ea5711ac5a44c0860.poster.avif?t=1713077723\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/deabc7c331839a1ea5711ac5a44c0860.webm?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/deabc7c331839a1ea5711ac5a44c0860.mp4?t=1713077723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆◆ Roguelike ◆◆</h2><br>Dungeons and enemy characters are randomly generated and upgrades cannot be carried over to the next playthrough. (PermaDeath)<br>Defeating a boss unlocks new skills and custom appearance elements.<br>There are no leveling or multiplayer elements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1379120/extras/da5fba89ae1b560c391e8a0c06b8a912.poster.avif?t=1